    149 |         ancestor = bpf_cgroup_ancestor(cgrp, 1);
        |                    ^
  progs/cgroup_read_xattr.c:149:11: error: incompatible integer to pointer conversion assigning to 'struct cgroup *' from 'int' [-Wint-conversion]
    149 |         ancestor = bpf_cgroup_ancestor(cgrp, 1);
        |                  ^ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  progs/cgroup_read_xattr.c:154:2: error: call to undeclared function 'bpf_cgroup_release'; ISO C99 and later do not support implicit function declarations [-Wimplicit-function-declaration]
